stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Admission
    Admission --> Reserved: Atomic capacity check
    Admission --> Rejected: Guard or quota
    Reserved --> Awaiting: Dispatch stable turn once
    Reserved --> Recovering: Crash before dispatch
    Awaiting --> SuccessReceipt: AI saves answer and receipt
    Awaiting --> FailureReceipt: Definitive AI failure
    Awaiting --> Recovering: Disconnect, timeout or restart
    Recovering --> Recovering: Outcome unavailable, keep slot
    Recovering --> SuccessReceipt: Saved answer found
    Recovering --> FailureReceipt: Cancel tombstone committed
    SuccessReceipt --> Debited: Commit captured window once
    FailureReceipt --> Released: Release captured window once
    Debited --> Delivered: Result or replay
    Debited --> Removed: Deleted answer, keep debit
    Released --> TerminalError: Same key cannot restart
    Delivered --> [*]
    Removed --> [*]
    TerminalError --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
